## Context

Once the pipeline is clean (0313) and figures are updated (0314, 0315),
the manuscript `slides/manuscript/main.md` needs a final figure-injection
pass to freeze the narrative. Statistical test results from 0316 are also
injected here.

Author decision (2026-05-25): the ablation heatmap moves to an annex,
not the main body.

## Work items

1. **Figure injection** — confirm all figures referenced in `main.md` exist
   under `report/inputs/generated/` and render correctly in the PDF.
   Current known gap: `fig_spider_exp1_families.pdf` has no build rule
   (noted 2026-05-25) — resolve or remove reference.

2. **Spider** — once 0311 (spider 4-way) is unblocked by 0313,
   wire `fig_spider_exp2_4way.pdf` into the manuscript.

3. **Heatmap to annex** — move the `fig_ablation_heatmap` `\includegraphics`
   block in `main.md` from the main body to an `## Annex` section.

4. **Statistical results** — inline the key p-values and effect sizes
   from 0316 into the relevant figure captions and results paragraphs.

5. **Narrative freeze** — after figures and stats are injected, do a single
   editorial pass to ensure every figure caption matches what the figure
   actually shows (labels, axis ranges, N counts).

## Exit criteria

- [ ] All `main.md` figure references resolve to existing files
- [ ] `fig_spider_exp1_families` gap resolved (build rule added or reference removed)
- [ ] Heatmap in annex section, not main body
- [ ] Statistical results from 0316 cited in text
- [ ] `make manuscript` produces a clean PDF
- [ ] `make check-fast` passes
